#: data/maps/Route112/scripts.inc:109
msgctxt "Route112_Text_LeaderGoingToAwakenThing"
msgid ""
"Hey, man, is our leader really going\n"
"to awaken that thing?$"
msgstr ""
"喂，老兄，\n"
"我们首领真的要唤醒那个东西吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route112/scripts.inc:113
msgctxt "Route112_Text_YeahWeNeedMeteorite"
msgid ""
"Sounds like it, yeah. But I heard\n"
"we need a METEORITE to do it.$"
msgstr ""
"好像是吧。\n"
"不过我听说要做到这一点需要陨石。$"

#: data/maps/Route112/scripts.inc:117
msgctxt "Route112_Text_OhThatsWhyCrewWentToFallarbor"
msgid ""
"Oh, I get it now. That's why the rest\n"
"of the crew went out to FALLARBOR.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，我明白了。\n"
"所以其他队员才去了秋叶镇啊。$"

#: data/maps/Route112/scripts.inc:121
msgctxt "Route112_Text_CantLetAnyonePassUntilTheyreBack"
msgid ""
"You got it. And until they come back,\n"
"we're not to let anyone pass, right.$"
msgstr ""
"没错。在他们回来之前，\n"
"我们不能让任何人通过。$"

#: data/maps/Route112/scripts.inc:125
msgctxt "Route112_Text_NotEasyToGetBackToLavaridge"
msgid ""
"Eh, I'd like to get to MAUVILLE, but if\n"
"I went down these ledges, it'd be no\l"
"easy matter to get back to LAVARIDGE.$"
msgstr ""
"唉，我想去紫堇市，可是要是从这些台阶\n"
"跳下去，再想回釜炎乡可就不容易了。$"

#: data/maps/Route112/scripts.inc:130
msgctxt "Route112_Text_MtChimneyCableCarSign"
msgid ""
"MT. CHIMNEY CABLE CAR\n"
"“A short walk {UP_ARROW} way!”$"
msgstr ""
"烟囱山缆车\n"
"“往{UP_ARROW}走一小段路就到！”$"

#: data/maps/Route112/scripts.inc:134
msgctxt "Route112_Text_MtChimneySign"
msgid ""
"MT. CHIMNEY\p"
"“For LAVARIDGE TOWN or the summit,\n"
"please take the CABLE CAR.”$"
msgstr ""
"烟囱山\p"
"“前往釜炎乡或山顶，请乘坐缆车。”$"

#: data/maps/Route112/scripts.inc:139
msgctxt "Route112_Text_RouteSignLavaridge"
msgid ""
"ROUTE 112\n"
"{LEFT_ARROW} LAVARIDGE TOWN$"
msgstr ""
"112号道路\n"
"{LEFT_ARROW} 釜炎乡$"
